{
  "id": 373929627,
  "iid": 19457,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Fix relatedPacketDelegate size hint",
  "description": "If the relatedPacketDelegate is set on a column, then\nQTreeView::sizeHintForColumn already calls it for all the\nindexes in the row. That means we can't add the result from\nrelatedPacketDelegate::sizeHint (even for an invalid index)\nto the result from QTreeView::sizeHintForColumn.\n\nThe right thing is to just have RelatedPacketDelegate::sizeHint\nreturn the correct size.\n\nThe correct hint, with some styles, is a bit different than just\nadding the decoration size, because some (many?) styles put some\npadding between the decoration and the text. Instead of adding\nin the known fixed decoration size, properly initialize our\nstyle option and call sizeHint.\n\nFix #20466\n\n(There's a separate issue mentioned there about how the related\npacket symbols are always associated with the first column, not\nthe first visible column, and thus aren't shown if the first column\nis not visible.)",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-04-02T17:46:36.727Z",
